Recursive walk:
```python
def leaves(o, path=''):
    if isinstance(o,dict):
        for k,v in o.items(): yield from leaves(v, f'{path}.{k}' if path else str(k))
    elif isinstance(o,list):
        for i,v in enumerate(o): yield from leaves(v, f'{path}[{i}]')
    elif isinstance(o,str):
        yield path,o
```

